WEBVTT

00:06.630 --> 00:09.200
Good morning, my dear husband.

00:10.770 --> 00:12.830
W-Why are you here?!

00:13.210 --> 00:17.660
Why? Because we are
a married couple, that's natural.

00:17.660 --> 00:20.250
Oh, right, I just remember.

00:21.960 --> 00:26.420
Please take care of me from now on,
my dear husband.

00:26.840 --> 00:29.130
Now, come here.

00:30.070 --> 00:34.720
I am prepared to devote
my body and heart to you.

00:34.720 --> 00:37.310
Wait! We can't do this!

00:38.690 --> 00:41.650
Are you saying that you hate me?

00:41.650 --> 00:43.310
That's not what I meant.

00:43.310 --> 00:49.110
There's an order, a procedure,
an emotional arrangement, and so on.

00:49.530 --> 00:53.560
Marriage in the human race
is a pain in the ass.

00:53.560 --> 00:56.540
Anyway, it's still a no.

00:56.540 --> 00:58.330
I'll sleep in the hallway.

00:58.870 --> 01:03.580
If Balirossa and the others see you,
they will suspect our relationship.

01:07.630 --> 01:10.630
So we've to sleep in the same room
from now on, huh?

01:10.630 --> 01:14.930
Come on, dear.
Let me help you get dressed.

01:14.930 --> 01:16.470
No, I'm fine!

01:16.470 --> 01:18.060
Don't hesitate!

01:18.060 --> 01:19.350
Hey, wait!

01:21.140 --> 01:24.020
Sir Flio, it's about today's training—

01:25.480 --> 01:27.870
S-Sorry for disturbing you!

01:29.070 --> 01:32.280
She definitely misunderstood us.

01:45.670 --> 01:57.430
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

03:08.840 --> 03:12.300
I am Balirossa,
a knight of Klyrode Knights!

03:12.650 --> 03:14.100
Now, let's fight—

03:15.130 --> 03:17.300
#3: START LIVING IN ANOTHER WORLD
It's not fair to attack before

03:17.300 --> 03:19.100
#3: START LIVING IN ANOTHER WORLD
I've finished my introductions!

03:26.560 --> 03:27.770
Belano, use your spell.

03:28.600 --> 03:30.020
Deploying defensive spell.

03:31.540 --> 03:32.820
Do it now, Byleri!

03:33.110 --> 03:34.850
Y-Yes!

03:40.360 --> 03:41.740
My magic is fading...

03:41.740 --> 03:42.620
Huh?

03:42.620 --> 03:43.700
I feel sick...

03:54.010 --> 03:59.930
They asked us to be trained, but it seems
they still have a long way to go.

04:06.530 --> 04:08.850
This room is really great!

04:11.440 --> 04:13.230
The beds are so fluffy too!

04:13.230 --> 04:16.440
Are you sure we can use this room?

04:16.440 --> 04:17.320
Of course.

04:17.320 --> 04:22.830
As a reward for defeating psychobears,
we got this house for a discount.

04:23.120 --> 04:25.750
It will take time to train you all.

04:25.750 --> 04:29.040
So I can't let you sleep on the floor.

04:29.500 --> 04:30.750
I am grateful to you.

04:30.750 --> 04:32.040
Thank you.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.630
Dear!

04:33.980 --> 04:36.090
The meal is ready.

04:38.050 --> 04:40.180
T-This is...

04:40.180 --> 04:43.890
Fresh raw meat from
the mountain boar we hunt earlier.

04:44.310 --> 04:46.270
For the celebration of our new home,

04:46.270 --> 04:49.140
I have prepared a luxury slice
for each one of us.

04:49.140 --> 04:50.730
Please enjoy!

04:51.130 --> 04:57.320
Umm, Rys, I think we'd be happier
with the cooked meat.

04:57.320 --> 05:00.070
Well, shall I grill it?

05:00.070 --> 05:04.160
It's fine, I'll take it from here.
You can relax and wait.

05:04.160 --> 05:06.190
Let me help you!

05:07.370 --> 05:11.120
But meat tastes best when it's raw.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.790
Isn't that right, Sybe?

05:15.550 --> 05:18.710
Thank you for waiting.
I hope it tastes okay.

05:19.510 --> 05:21.010
It looks delicious!

05:21.760 --> 05:23.680
Did you make this with magic?

05:24.010 --> 05:27.640
No, I didn't. After all, I like to cook.

05:27.640 --> 05:29.890
And Balirossa helped me too.

05:29.890 --> 05:32.690
I was surprised at
how well she cooked the food.

05:33.190 --> 05:36.820
Honestly, I'm better at cooking
than using a sword.

05:36.820 --> 05:41.400
It's embarrassing.
I came from a fallen noble family.

05:41.400 --> 05:43.240
We couldn't hire a cook,

05:43.750 --> 05:46.700
so I had to make my own meals.

05:47.050 --> 05:48.330
Then, let's eat.

05:48.330 --> 05:49.040
Yes.

05:49.660 --> 05:51.160
This is delicious!

05:51.160 --> 05:53.420
My cheeks are about to fall off!

05:53.780 --> 05:55.880
There's no way it can taste good.

05:56.290 --> 06:01.130
These leaves are the food for weak animals
that can't hunt for meat.

06:01.130 --> 06:02.970
But it's nutritious.

06:02.970 --> 06:05.090
I made that salad.

06:05.970 --> 06:08.010
If you don't eat it, I'll take it.

06:08.010 --> 06:12.020
No, you can't! This is something
that my husband made.

06:12.020 --> 06:14.400
Even if it's a leaf...

06:16.610 --> 06:18.270
It's delicious...

06:18.270 --> 06:19.650
I'm glad.

06:19.650 --> 06:21.410
You should try the meat too.

06:23.740 --> 06:25.360
What is this?

06:25.870 --> 06:28.660
Crispy on the outside and juicy inside.

06:28.660 --> 06:33.210
The juices overflowing from the meat
are concentrated and rich like honey.

06:33.210 --> 06:37.440
You can't get such a complex flavor
just by grilling it!

06:37.880 --> 06:40.460
Balirossa grilled that meat.

06:41.460 --> 06:45.090
How is it, Lady Rys?
Was the meat overcooked?

06:46.050 --> 06:49.390
No, it was well done.

06:49.390 --> 06:53.100
I will make a home-cooked meal
next time as a thanks.

06:53.100 --> 06:54.730
That would be great.

06:55.140 --> 06:57.060
I look forward to it.

06:58.020 --> 07:00.270
So many mountain boars...

07:00.650 --> 07:04.240
How can he hunt so many of them
every time?

07:07.990 --> 07:09.950
Maybe I've gone a little overboard.

07:09.950 --> 07:12.370
Uh, dear...

07:12.740 --> 07:17.330
Can I go around town while
waiting for their assessment?

07:17.800 --> 07:20.590
That's fine.
Do you want me to go with you?

07:20.880 --> 07:25.340
Ah, no... I have some personal
business to attend to.

07:25.340 --> 07:26.760
I see.

07:26.760 --> 07:28.010
Sir Flio.

07:28.010 --> 07:28.720
Yes?

07:29.280 --> 07:32.720
I am Leolith of the Adventurers' Guild.

07:32.720 --> 07:35.980
There's something I'd like to discuss
if you don't mind.

07:35.980 --> 07:37.350
Sure.

07:37.350 --> 07:40.610
Then, I'll wait for you here
when the assessment is over.

07:40.610 --> 07:41.570
Yes!

07:48.910 --> 07:51.530
Now, I have to work hard!

07:52.530 --> 07:57.960
Your fame has spread not only
in the guild but also in the entire city.

07:58.330 --> 08:00.540
As expected, I went overboard...

08:00.910 --> 08:04.000
The truth is, after hearing about
your achievements,

08:04.000 --> 08:08.760
there's an invitation for you
to work under the Hero.

08:09.260 --> 08:13.760
If you accepted it, the King would
appoint you as an honorary knight.

08:14.180 --> 08:17.100
Me as an honorary knight?

08:17.100 --> 08:20.190
You hunted so many A-Rank magic beasts.

08:20.190 --> 08:25.190
And with just two adventurers to boot,
I wouldn't believe it if I hadn't seen it myself.

08:25.190 --> 08:29.570
To be honest, the guild doesn't
want to let you go.

08:29.570 --> 08:33.659
But to save the world, I'd like you
to help them using your power.

08:34.289 --> 08:37.659
I think this is a chance
that won't come again for you.

08:38.120 --> 08:42.880
I guess for the inhabitants of this world,
there are no greater offers than this.

08:43.539 --> 08:44.710
But still...

08:45.550 --> 08:50.470
I came from another world,
so I have no reason to fight the demons.

08:51.390 --> 08:53.220
I'm sorry, but...

08:53.760 --> 08:55.640
I don't have any interest.

08:59.020 --> 09:01.100
D-Dear...

09:01.690 --> 09:04.110
Sorry to make you wait.

09:04.110 --> 09:05.070
Rys?!

09:05.430 --> 09:08.770
What happened?
Were you attacked by magic beasts?

09:09.360 --> 09:12.410
No, it's not like that.

09:12.750 --> 09:18.120
I didn't know cooking was so hard.

09:18.120 --> 09:24.460
Ladies, let's capture your lover's
stomachs and win their love.

09:24.810 --> 09:26.380
Win their love?

09:26.380 --> 09:28.920
First, let's peel the skin.

09:33.930 --> 09:37.150
Sprinkle some flour on it.

09:40.390 --> 09:43.480
Simmer it slowly over low heat...

09:43.480 --> 09:45.690
It's such a hassle.

09:52.950 --> 09:59.450
I, Fenrys, won't give in to human cooking
until I can win my dear's love!

10:02.330 --> 10:06.130
Oh, there's such a fierce warrior
in the Adventurers' Guild?

10:06.130 --> 10:13.010
I heard that the two of them are hunting
an unbelievable number of magic beasts.

10:13.010 --> 10:15.720
The King would be happy

10:15.720 --> 10:22.560
if those two could help you to resume
the fight against the Dark One.

10:23.440 --> 10:25.520
Then bring them to me
as soon as possible.

10:25.520 --> 10:30.650
Let them work under me.

10:31.610 --> 10:32.570
ONE MONTH LATER

10:32.570 --> 10:34.740
ONE MONTH LATER
My answer will be always the same.

10:35.160 --> 10:37.950
I have no intention to accept
the request from the Castle.

10:38.370 --> 10:40.660
Please leave.

10:41.370 --> 10:45.620
They have been persistent over
and over again during the past month.

10:46.040 --> 10:49.380
Shall I make sure that
they won't come back here again?

10:49.380 --> 10:51.010
Just leave them be.

10:51.010 --> 10:54.300
They are just doing their work.

10:54.300 --> 10:57.600
More importantly,
we have to attend to their training.

10:59.430 --> 11:02.680
Wow! The fields are totally revitalized.

11:04.100 --> 11:08.650
We can't just take things for granted,
so at least we have to do this.

11:09.610 --> 11:12.230
Sybe helped me, too

11:13.610 --> 11:16.570
Leave the fieldwork to us.

11:16.570 --> 11:18.160
Right?

11:18.160 --> 11:22.200
Because of that, I don't see her putting
much effort into sword training anymore.

11:23.580 --> 11:26.670
I... I can't do it!

11:26.670 --> 11:31.050
You can't keep aiming at wooden targets.

11:31.450 --> 11:35.260
But they are too cute,
I feel sorry for them.

11:35.260 --> 11:38.680
I don't want to shoot arrows at them.

11:38.680 --> 11:42.220
Many-eye bird's meat is tender
and delicious, you know?

11:42.600 --> 11:46.310
You always try to appeal with food.

11:46.310 --> 11:48.940
I can't do something that I can't do!

11:50.440 --> 11:51.400
Belano.

11:51.860 --> 11:54.740
I made a ring that increases one's magic.

11:54.740 --> 11:55.990
Can you try it?

11:56.490 --> 11:58.360
This should increase your magic power.

12:00.370 --> 12:03.040
Try it for the day
and see how it goes.

12:03.040 --> 12:04.330
Yes.

12:10.330 --> 12:15.420
I won't forgive you if you put it on
the ring finger, do you understand?

12:18.300 --> 12:20.140
Sir Flio!

12:20.490 --> 12:21.640
Balirossa?!

12:25.300 --> 12:29.230
Drop the helpless act, Balirossa.

12:29.770 --> 12:34.530
I know that you can handle
a C-Rank magic beast.

12:34.530 --> 12:36.690
Lady Rys...

12:36.690 --> 12:42.240
It's obvious that you're trying
to look weak to my husband.

12:42.240 --> 12:44.540
I-I don't know what you mean.

12:49.620 --> 12:52.080
Everyone, please try it!

12:52.080 --> 12:52.670
Wow!

12:53.130 --> 12:55.090
This is really a proper food.

12:55.090 --> 12:56.170
So good.

12:56.170 --> 12:58.510
This is a huge step up from raw meat!

12:58.510 --> 13:00.720
Yes, I'm so amazed.

13:01.150 --> 13:02.970
You're amazing, Rys!

13:02.970 --> 13:05.890
When did you learn to cook?

13:05.890 --> 13:11.100
The truth is, I took a cooking class
while you had business at the guild.

13:11.520 --> 13:14.610
At first, I thought cooking was a hassle.

13:14.610 --> 13:19.240
I was always thinking of
making it quick using magic.

13:19.630 --> 13:20.450
However...

13:24.450 --> 13:26.240
It's so strange.

13:26.240 --> 13:28.790
All I knew to do was to fight,

13:28.790 --> 13:31.960
but lately, I've been learning
to do new things, bit by bit.

13:32.330 --> 13:35.340
It feels even better than
getting stronger.

13:36.500 --> 13:40.380
That's right! I made one more
food for you, my dear.

13:40.380 --> 13:42.300
Please try it!

13:42.750 --> 13:46.680
To win your lover's heart,
I recommend curry.

13:46.680 --> 13:51.190
You can put more spices called love in it!

13:52.900 --> 13:55.980
How is it?

13:55.980 --> 13:58.530
It's delicious!

13:58.530 --> 14:00.150
I can eat as many as I can.

14:00.150 --> 14:02.740
I'm so happy!

14:04.490 --> 14:07.500
There's no mistake, that's Fenrys.

14:12.330 --> 14:17.800
What is the most feared
female warrior in the Dark Army

14:17.800 --> 14:21.010
doing here surrounded by humans?

14:21.360 --> 14:25.180
You too.
What are you doing here, Uliminas?

14:28.810 --> 14:30.350
Please enjoy the tea.

14:31.810 --> 14:34.350
T-Thank you very much.

14:34.350 --> 14:35.400
Hot!

14:35.400 --> 14:37.860
So, what's your business here?

14:38.270 --> 14:42.490
I don't think a confederate of
the Dark One would come here to play.

14:42.490 --> 14:43.860
Confederate of the Dark One?!

14:44.280 --> 14:46.620
I came to investigate this area.

14:46.620 --> 14:49.370
Then I happened to see you.

14:49.750 --> 14:53.410
I'm living here now,
together with my husband.

14:53.410 --> 14:54.620
Your husband?!

14:54.620 --> 14:57.540
Yes, we got married.

14:57.540 --> 15:00.340
You are not going
to disturb us, are you?

15:00.340 --> 15:03.010
O-Of course not.

15:03.010 --> 15:04.170
Hot!

15:04.560 --> 15:07.010
Is she okay?
Is it too hot?

15:07.010 --> 15:09.050
Not at all.

15:09.050 --> 15:12.220
The temperature is just right.
It's very good.

15:12.220 --> 15:13.640
That's fine, then.

15:16.850 --> 15:20.190
She looks like a different person
from when she was in the Dark Army.

15:20.190 --> 15:24.610
And how can he be so calm
in the presence of me, a demon?

15:24.610 --> 15:25.950
More than anything else...

15:26.450 --> 15:32.330
My Combat Analysis Magic
can't read his stats at all.

15:32.330 --> 15:36.250
Not even the Dark One can
hide his stats from me.

15:36.250 --> 15:40.710
B-But, there have been some changes
around here lately.

15:40.710 --> 15:44.720
Especially in the Delaveza Forest,
I couldn't find any magic beasts.

15:44.720 --> 15:47.340
Oh, that forest...

15:47.340 --> 15:49.720
If there are no more
magic beasts in that forest,

15:49.720 --> 15:53.560
that means the Purification I cast
at that time did work after all.

15:55.350 --> 15:57.640
H-Hold on a second!

15:57.640 --> 16:00.520
The one who cast Purification was you?!

16:00.520 --> 16:02.020
Yes, that's right.

16:02.020 --> 16:04.900
Fenrys, didn't you know?!

16:04.900 --> 16:10.620
This man killed your brother,
Fengaryl, and his entire troop!

16:11.830 --> 16:16.500
Even now, we still can't contact
Fengaryl who was stationed there.

16:16.500 --> 16:18.670
There's no doubt that your brother—

16:18.670 --> 16:20.880
Silence, Uliminas.

16:21.280 --> 16:23.750
Is that true?

16:23.750 --> 16:27.760
You knew that I was the one
who killed your brother?

16:28.300 --> 16:32.720
There are very few humans
that can cast Purification.

16:32.720 --> 16:34.260
Somehow I figured it out.

16:34.260 --> 16:35.720
So that means...

16:35.720 --> 16:38.270
My brother was a lupine warrior.

16:38.270 --> 16:42.440
He will hate nothing more than
his death to be pitied.

16:42.440 --> 16:48.990
It's his fault for losing so easily
even though he was one of the Infernal Four.

16:48.990 --> 16:51.620
Well, that's true...

16:52.070 --> 16:57.370
I was falling in love with your strength
and decided to make you my master.

16:57.370 --> 17:00.960
My feelings won't change no matter what.

17:03.210 --> 17:07.760
My apologies. We didn't mean to
eavesdrop on your conversation.

17:07.760 --> 17:09.970
We could hear it very clearly.

17:09.970 --> 17:15.220
To think Rys is that Fenrys...

17:16.810 --> 17:18.790
Is she okay?!

17:18.790 --> 17:21.400
This man is a threat to the Dark Army.

17:21.730 --> 17:26.359
That means, Fenrys has become
the enemy of the Dark Army too.

17:26.359 --> 17:30.990
By the way, Mister.
Would you mind sparring with me?

17:30.990 --> 17:35.450
I'd like to see how strong
the man Fenrys fell in love with.

17:35.450 --> 17:37.910
I'm not that strong.

17:37.910 --> 17:40.910
I'll take them both at once.

17:40.910 --> 17:43.040
You must not accept it,
my dear husband!

17:43.040 --> 17:48.630
This woman must be planning to make out
with you under the guise of a mock battle!

17:48.630 --> 17:51.840
There's no way I would do that!

17:53.140 --> 17:54.800
The rule is simple.

17:55.170 --> 17:59.270
Magic is allowed.
We fight until someone surrenders.

17:59.690 --> 18:00.810
I understand.

18:00.810 --> 18:03.100
I'm ready whenever you are.

18:03.450 --> 18:05.860
All right, here I come!

18:09.400 --> 18:11.360
Cat Venom Claw!

18:12.570 --> 18:14.570
First, distract them.

18:14.930 --> 18:17.030
And then, a simultaneous attack
from below.

18:18.580 --> 18:20.370
Dispel.

18:24.790 --> 18:27.630
What?! He dispelled both spells
in an instant?!

18:28.050 --> 18:29.210
Crucifixion.

18:30.670 --> 18:33.090
I can't move my body!

18:33.090 --> 18:35.090
Your opponent is me.

18:35.720 --> 18:38.430
I won't allow you to attack Rys.

18:40.680 --> 18:43.690
I... I surrender.

18:45.210 --> 18:47.230
I'm sorry for hiding this until now.

18:47.690 --> 18:52.990
I thought it would be a trouble
if you knew Rys' true identity.

18:53.700 --> 18:57.780
I don't mind for you
to report us to the Castle.

18:58.180 --> 19:01.290
But let me say this.

19:02.120 --> 19:05.420
I've decided to devote myself
to my husband.

19:05.420 --> 19:08.380
I'm not part of the Dark Army anymore.

19:09.130 --> 19:14.900
As Sir Flio said, this matter needs
to be reported to the Castle.

19:15.550 --> 19:19.470
But we don't have to report someone
who doesn't have any ill intent against us.

19:20.430 --> 19:21.770
Balirossa...

19:22.280 --> 19:24.060
We already talked about this.

19:24.600 --> 19:29.190
We were trained by Rys
during this past month.

19:29.190 --> 19:31.650
To us, she is our benefactor.

19:31.990 --> 19:37.660
No matter how useless we are,
we can't betray our benefactor.

19:37.660 --> 19:38.740
Agree.

19:39.030 --> 19:41.230
Thank you, everyone.

19:46.750 --> 19:48.170
Are those...

19:52.380 --> 19:53.460
Uliminas!

19:53.460 --> 19:57.130
I came to thank you for
your hospitality last night.

19:57.130 --> 20:02.310
I will repay it by showing the power of
the most elite group in the Dark Army!

20:02.720 --> 20:03.720
Dragons?

20:03.720 --> 20:07.890
They are responsible for destroying
our army so many times in the past.

20:08.350 --> 20:13.110
I will let you live if you give in and
become the Dark One's subordinate—

20:13.110 --> 20:15.820
So these are dragons?!
It's the first time I've seen it!

20:17.400 --> 20:20.780
Were there no dragons in your world?

20:20.780 --> 20:23.700
There were, but I had never
seen them before.

20:23.700 --> 20:27.120
Once in a while, I sold products
made from the dragon's scale.

20:27.120 --> 20:29.540
How dare you act so carefree?!

20:30.000 --> 20:32.340
You are courting death!

20:32.880 --> 20:34.550
Holy Magic...

20:35.590 --> 20:37.010
Heavenly Hammer!

20:48.770 --> 20:50.770
I-Impossible...

20:51.190 --> 20:54.730
The strongest dragons of the Dark Army
were wiped out in an instant...

20:55.610 --> 20:58.700
Hey! Don't leave me behind!

20:58.700 --> 21:03.120
She's a fool who dared to bare
her fangs at my husband.

21:03.120 --> 21:04.530
That's amazing!

21:04.530 --> 21:07.290
I should've taken advantage
and thrown my hoe at them too.

21:07.610 --> 21:12.500
Maybe I could earn
the Dragonslayer title and level up.

21:12.500 --> 21:13.890
Want to give it a try?

21:14.590 --> 21:16.130
Just throw that to them.

21:16.130 --> 21:17.260
Okay, then.

21:17.880 --> 21:20.970
And... here goes!

21:21.510 --> 21:24.600
Enhancement Magic.
Haste, Pierce, Sanctify.

21:30.190 --> 21:33.360
I really got the Dragonslayer title!

21:34.230 --> 21:36.530
Sir Flio, please let me do it as well!

21:36.530 --> 21:37.400
Me too.

21:37.400 --> 21:38.650
Me too!

21:38.650 --> 21:39.610
