we can't see them anymore.

21:45.280 --> 21:46.910
Is that so...

21:47.490 --> 21:49.330
Is that so?

21:50.620 --> 21:53.710
Is that so?!

21:53.710 --> 22:00.170
He's no Hero, just a mere adventurer,
yet he wields such power.

22:01.880 --> 22:03.010
Lord Gholl!

22:04.720 --> 22:06.910
I will go there next.

23:40.940 --> 23:43.820
My name is Balirossa.
I'm good at making pastries.

23:43.820 --> 23:46.360
Leave all the field works to me, Blossom!

23:46.360 --> 23:48.780
I'm Belano, the weak witch.

23:48.780 --> 23:51.120
I am Byleri, and I...

23:51.120 --> 23:51.740
Hurry up!

23:51.740 --> 23:53.660
Byleri knows all about romance.

23:53.660 --> 23:56.040
She got all kinds of novels
hidden under her bed.

23:56.040 --> 23:56.710
Hey, that's a secret!

23:56.710 --> 23:58.210
NEXT: AN UNEXPECTED VISITOR
Hey, that's a secret!

23:58.210 --> 24:00.000
